    "motor": {
      "type": "ind-image-text",
      "settings": {
        "scheme": "dark",
        "accent": "#9cc25a",
        "reverse": false,
        "wide_media": true,
        "ratio": "landscape",
        "placeholder_label": "Photo: Abrelune driving across grass or gravel, loaded",
        "badge_value": "1000 W",
        "badge_label": "Brushless motor",
        "eyebrow": "Motor performance",
        "heading": "Real power on every surface",
        "text": "<p>Two-wheel drive delivers traction on grass, gravel, paths and uneven ground. Drive slowly and precisely with the stepless twist throttle in tight spots, or switch speed modes and travel at up to about 24 km/h on open stretches.</p>",
        "checks": "Brushless 1000 W electric motor\nTwo-wheel drive for traction\nStepless twist-grip throttle\nTwo speed modes, forward and reverse\nLED headlight and horn",
        "btn_style": "accent",
        "diagram": "none"
      }
    },
    "battery": {
      "type": "ind-image-text",
      "settings": {
        "scheme": "sand",
        "accent": "#4f6b2a",
        "reverse": true,
        "wide_media": false,
        "ratio": "square",
        "placeholder_label": "Photo: battery compartment opened for charging",
        "badge_value": "4–5 h",
        "badge_label": "Full charge",
        "eyebrow": "Battery technology",
        "heading": "Power for the whole working day",
        "text": "<p>A sealed 48 V lead-acid battery system powers the motor. On one charge you'll cover about 24–27 km, depending on load and surface, which is enough for many work sessions around the property. Plug in overnight, or between jobs, and it's fully charged in about 4–5 hours.</p>",
        "checks": "Sealed 48 V battery system\nApprox. 24–27 km per charge*\nApprox. 4–5 hours to full charge\nBattery indicator shows remaining charge\nAccessible battery compartment",
        "btn_style": "dark",
        "note": "* Depends on load, surface, gradient and battery condition.",
        "diagram": "none"
      }
    },
